<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>INSTALL LIBRARIES</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>安装深度学习库：PyTorch + Transformers + LangChain</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 3, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        {[
          { t: 'PyTorch', c: 'conda install pytorch torchvision cudatoolkit', d: '深度学习框架' },
          { t: 'Transformers', c: 'pip install transformers', d: 'Hugging Face 模型库' },
          { t: 'LangChain', c: 'pip install langchain', d: 'LLM 应用框架' },
        ].map((item, idx) => (
          <Box key={idx} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 8 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>{item.t}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>{item.d}</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>{item.c}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}
        <Box style={{ background: '#DCE7F5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', marginTop: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>
            python -c "import torch; print(torch.__version__)"
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 2, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '28px 26px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 14 }}>安装顺序的为什么</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          Python 是地基 → PyTorch 提供推理引擎 → Transformers 帮你加载模型 → LangChain 让你写应用。
          <br /><br />
          每一层都建立在上一层之上，顺序错了会踩坑。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
            验证安装是习惯：装完必验，报错先查版本
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: 'calc(100% - 120px)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 2 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>05 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
